WEBVTT

01:40.520 --> 01:41.920
When people are down and out,

01:43.360 --> 01:44.400
they're like falling leaves

01:45.360 --> 01:46.480
who can't control

01:47.840 --> 01:49.480
their fate.

01:58.440 --> 02:00.640
The Duke Mansion has no place
for such falling leaves.

02:01.440 --> 02:02.320
But Li,

02:03.520 --> 02:04.480
there are still

02:05.360 --> 02:06.600
a lot of possibilities for you.

02:07.160 --> 02:08.000
My lord,

02:08.080 --> 02:09.520
breakfast is ready in the hall.

02:10.400 --> 02:11.360
Ms. Jiang Li,

02:11.920 --> 02:12.760
after you.

02:24.680 --> 02:26.120
Where's Ms. Situ?

02:26.200 --> 02:27.080
She left.

02:27.160 --> 02:29.000
No live person
stays overnight in my courtyard.

02:29.080 --> 02:29.920
Then…

02:30.480 --> 02:31.320
You were dead asleep.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.320
It doesn't count.

02:33.320 --> 02:34.160
Eat up.

02:37.520 --> 02:39.120
Father, the pan-fried dumplings are done.

02:39.600 --> 02:40.840
- Be careful.
- It's so hot.

02:40.920 --> 02:42.640
- Are you all right?
- Xue Li, it's so hot.

02:45.760 --> 02:47.080
Do you feel better?

02:47.160 --> 02:49.600
Enough, stop fooling around.
The porridge is getting cold.

02:49.680 --> 02:50.680
- All right.
- Come and eat.

02:50.760 --> 02:51.600
Let's eat.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.760
Your porridge is getting cold.

02:55.080 --> 02:55.960
What's the matter?

02:56.040 --> 02:58.720
Are you moved to tears just for a meal?

02:58.800 --> 03:00.960
- I'm not crying.
- Don't speak when eating or sleeping.

03:10.400 --> 03:12.000
- Father.
- Thank you.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.000
- It smells good.
- Want one?

03:13.480 --> 03:14.320
I'll eat this one.

03:15.640 --> 03:17.440
- Try this meat bun.
- Try this meat bun.

03:17.520 --> 03:19.520
The servants purposely went out
and bought them.

03:19.600 --> 03:20.800
- It is especially--
- Duke Su,

03:21.800 --> 03:24.040
don't speak when eating or sleeping.

03:36.960 --> 03:40.520
ANNUAL EXAM, FIRST DAY

03:46.200 --> 03:47.240
Ms. Jiang Li.

03:51.920 --> 03:53.280
You are so late.

03:53.360 --> 03:55.200
I thought you didn't dare to come.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.160
No way.

03:56.240 --> 03:58.200
I remember the bet.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.280
Good.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.600
Mr. Li!

04:11.680 --> 04:14.200
- Mr. Li!
- Mr. Li!

05:02.440 --> 05:05.320
STUDY AND THINK DILIGENTLY DAILY
TO GAIN PROFOUND UNDERSTANDING

05:05.400 --> 05:07.320
This year's Annual Exam will begin soon.

05:07.800 --> 05:09.720
I believe all of you are well-prepared.

05:11.200 --> 05:12.280
The rules are the same.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.760
The team in the last place

05:14.840 --> 05:17.240
will leave the School of Integrity
and the Imperial Academy.

05:18.160 --> 05:19.560
Good luck.

05:19.640 --> 05:22.760
His Majesty appointed the Academy's
Educational Commissioner.

05:22.840 --> 05:26.360
This Annual Exam
will be hosted by Mr. Shen.

05:58.680 --> 05:59.640
Jiang Li.

05:59.720 --> 06:00.560
Jiang Li.

06:00.640 --> 06:01.760
What are you thinking about?

06:02.760 --> 06:03.640
It's starting.

06:12.240 --> 06:13.160
Mr. Shen,

06:14.840 --> 06:15.960
can we begin?

06:17.080 --> 06:17.920
Let's begin.

06:18.760 --> 06:20.400
The first academic exam

06:20.920 --> 06:22.520
begins!

07:03.920 --> 07:04.960
Duke Su,

07:05.040 --> 07:06.320
regarding the few days you asked,

07:07.400 --> 07:09.840
it was Little Taohong
who performed on stage.

07:10.640 --> 07:12.200
What were the programs after that?

07:14.480 --> 07:16.080
Mr. Xiao's "Butcher Sun,"

07:16.160 --> 07:17.560
Mr. Zhang's "Tale of the Pipa,"

07:17.640 --> 07:20.880
and Little Taohong's "Case of Jiu'er."

07:20.960 --> 07:21.880
Got it.

07:22.440 --> 07:23.880
- You may go.
- All right.

07:28.040 --> 07:28.880
My lord,

07:29.440 --> 07:32.280
are you reluctant to leave
Little Taohong's performance?

07:34.440 --> 07:35.320
Investigate this lady.

07:36.200 --> 07:37.960
Don't alert anyone.

07:38.040 --> 07:40.400
Money has no legs,

07:40.480 --> 07:42.440
but it goes away faster
than everything else.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.080
Once you've verified it,

07:44.160 --> 07:45.960
I want you
to stop the money from going out.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.040
Yes.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.120
Stop.

07:53.200 --> 07:54.240
What's the rush?

07:54.320 --> 07:55.400
He's going to the gambling den.

07:55.480 --> 07:58.160
Why are you saying everything?

08:00.760 --> 08:02.680
Today is the day of the Annual Exam.

08:02.760 --> 08:05.320
The city's gambling dens
have a wager between Jiang and Li.

08:05.400 --> 08:07.040
Everyone is placing their bets like crazy.

08:08.440 --> 08:09.600
Did you place your bet?

08:09.680 --> 08:12.000
Of course. This is easy money.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.200
Li Lian will surely win.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.960
My lord, you are so generous today.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.480
Since I can't support
Little Taohong today,

08:23.480 --> 08:25.080
I'll support Ms. Jiang Li.

08:28.440 --> 08:30.160
WATCHING THE SEE AND SKY

08:37.919 --> 08:39.640
The people who advanced to the final round

08:40.679 --> 08:41.880
are Ye Shijie…

08:43.880 --> 08:44.720
Do your best.

08:47.160 --> 08:48.160
Li Jin.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.080
YE SHIJIE

09:03.160 --> 09:04.680
LI JIN

09:04.760 --> 09:06.120
Please listen to the question.

09:08.760 --> 09:11.280
The three rivers flow. Explain.

09:12.760 --> 09:13.840
It's from the Tribute of Yu.

09:13.920 --> 09:15.760
When the three rivers flow,
Zhenze will be safe.

09:15.840 --> 09:18.360
These are the three major rivers
in the Lake Tai Basin.

09:18.440 --> 09:20.880
Song River, Lou River, and Dong River.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.840
Correct.

09:21.920 --> 09:23.360
Ye Shijie gets one point.

09:24.920 --> 09:26.280
YE SHIJIE

09:27.920 --> 09:29.040
Next question.

09:32.280 --> 09:34.440
It's from the Book of Han,
Biography of Wei Xian.

09:34.520 --> 09:35.680
Educating a child is better

09:35.760 --> 09:36.800
than leaving him a fortune.

09:37.360 --> 09:40.280
It's from the Book of Han,
Biography of Xue Pingpeng.

09:40.360 --> 09:42.480
Learning is the noblest of human pursuits.

09:43.320 --> 09:45.040
This is from Master Lu's
Spring and Autumn Annals.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.480
Defeat oneself to defeat others.

09:46.560 --> 09:48.000
Ye Shijie gets one point.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.760
At this rate, the outcome is obvious.

09:50.280 --> 09:52.240
Mr. Ye's academic skills
are really amazing.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.240
Next question.

09:53.720 --> 09:56.280
Use a fake goal to mask your real goal
until it's achieved.

09:56.800 --> 10:00.440
In front of everyone, point west
when your goal is actually in the east.

10:00.520 --> 10:01.440
Explain.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.440
No answer from either of you?

10:19.200 --> 10:23.080
This is from the Book of Southern Qi,
Biography of Wang Jingze,

10:23.160 --> 10:24.360
one of the 36 Stratagems.

10:24.440 --> 10:27.000
It's easier to become careless
when one is well-prepared.

10:27.800 --> 10:29.840
Something habitual
makes people lose vigilance.

10:29.920 --> 10:31.440
The secret is hidden in public

10:31.520 --> 10:33.680
and not in something concealed in private.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.280
Correct.

10:35.360 --> 10:37.360
Li Jin gets one point.

10:38.800 --> 10:40.560
LI JIN

10:40.640 --> 10:42.000
That's how my brother is.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.680
He likes to make a comeback.

10:43.760 --> 10:44.680
Next question.

10:45.160 --> 10:47.000
It's from the Book of the Grand Historian,

10:47.080 --> 10:48.960
- Volume 65.
- Next question.

10:50.040 --> 10:52.640
Thinness and transparency
are the Tang jade cup's biggest features.

10:52.720 --> 10:55.600
It usually has embossed patterns
of clouds, plants, or people.

10:55.680 --> 10:56.560
One point.

10:57.880 --> 10:59.760
This is from Doctrine of the Mean.

11:01.040 --> 11:02.880
Li Jin gets one point.

11:04.840 --> 11:06.160
Last question.

11:08.200 --> 11:11.160
Indecisiveness loses a battle. Explain.

11:11.720 --> 11:13.200
From Spring and Autumn Annals
Year 25, Duke Xiang.

11:13.280 --> 11:15.280
If one is indecisive in playing Go,
he won't win.

11:18.400 --> 11:22.160
Ye Shijie and Li Jin get one point each.

11:25.440 --> 11:26.600
The first part is over.

11:26.680 --> 11:29.440
Li Jin is in first place.
Ye Shijie is in second place.

11:29.520 --> 11:32.160
This is bad.
I didn't expect Li Jin to be so good.

11:32.240 --> 11:34.080
The next question
is about politics and economy.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.120
Li Jin

11:35.200 --> 11:37.560
has been influenced by Chancellor Li
since he was little.

11:38.200 --> 11:40.080
I wonder if he's more confident in this.

11:40.840 --> 11:43.800
The final question about politics
and economy will be judged by Mr. Shen.

11:43.880 --> 11:45.880
Mr. Shen, please go ahead.

11:50.200 --> 11:53.960
This question is from His Majesty and I.

11:54.040 --> 11:57.240
If a new emperor ascends to the throne
and the Treasury is empty

11:57.320 --> 11:59.120
and there is corruption
within the government

11:59.200 --> 12:01.040
as well as frequent droughts,

12:01.120 --> 12:02.240
what is an effective method?

12:02.320 --> 12:04.360
At the start of a new era,
many things must be done.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.440
New things can't be established
if old things aren't abolished.

12:05.520 --> 12:06.840
Having many issues isn't a problem,

12:06.920 --> 12:08.680
but having people
who neglect their duties is.

12:09.280 --> 12:12.760
I think internal affairs must be dealt
with and corrupt officials punished.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.880
The dirty money
should be handed over to the Treasury

12:14.960 --> 12:16.600
then distributed to the disaster victims.

12:18.280 --> 12:20.640
Li Jin, what do you think?

12:20.720 --> 12:22.000
I think

12:22.080 --> 12:24.360
resolving the drought crisis is crucial.

12:24.440 --> 12:26.400
The corrupt officials
shouldn't be punished first

12:26.480 --> 12:28.760
to ensure smooth distribution
of money and food for disaster relief.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.680
Corrupt officials cannot be kept,

12:30.760 --> 12:33.480
but they're the main force in distributing
the relief aid at the moment.

12:33.560 --> 12:35.080
If the crisis is not well-resolved

12:35.160 --> 12:36.480
and the people's support is lost,

12:36.560 --> 12:39.720
the emperor's position will be in danger.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.360
Mr. Li's idea seems reasonable,

12:43.160 --> 12:44.680
but it furthers some people's interest.

12:44.760 --> 12:47.360
Even if the victims' problems
are resolved by this method,

12:47.960 --> 12:49.200
it's not a long-term solution.

12:49.280 --> 12:51.440
Since these corrupt officials
experienced the benefits,

12:51.520 --> 12:53.120
they won't let go of them.

12:53.200 --> 12:56.400
They'll take advantage of the crisis
to make money because that's their nature.

12:56.480 --> 12:58.800
In the end,
the victims and the emperor will suffer.

12:58.880 --> 13:00.840
Only corrupt officials
in between will benefit.

13:00.920 --> 13:04.240
Mr. Ye's vision is very good,

13:04.320 --> 13:06.000
but it is practical.

13:06.080 --> 13:08.280
In reality, I'm afraid
it can't be implemented at all.

13:08.360 --> 13:09.960
If you only seek integrity,

13:10.040 --> 13:10.920
Mr. Ye,

13:11.000 --> 13:13.640
there might be no official left.

13:14.200 --> 13:15.600
Everyone knows about the principles,

13:15.680 --> 13:17.080
but when it comes to execution,

13:17.160 --> 13:18.640
it is much more complicated

13:18.720 --> 13:19.920
than a theoretical discussion.

13:21.640 --> 13:24.240
- Right.
- He's the son of a Chancellor indeed.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.880
He is seeing the problem more clearly.

13:26.480 --> 13:28.720
Ye Shijie has no real-life experience.

13:29.320 --> 13:30.320
He may lose.

13:30.400 --> 13:32.960
This is bad. Why do I feel
like Ye Shijie is going to lose?

13:35.840 --> 13:36.760
No.

13:37.600 --> 13:38.480
Ye Shijie

13:39.560 --> 13:40.480
is going to win.

13:40.560 --> 13:41.400
Why?

13:43.120 --> 13:45.360
Why did His Majesty
reward you with so many things?

13:45.440 --> 13:46.640
His Majesty asked me today.

13:47.120 --> 13:49.080
Am I not afraid
that there will be no official left

13:49.160 --> 13:51.240
if corrupt ones are punished
during a natural disaster?

13:51.320 --> 13:53.120
What does it have to do
with rewarding you?

13:53.200 --> 13:54.920
I said I witnessed when I was little

13:55.000 --> 13:57.240
how my father was harmed
by corrupt officials,

13:57.320 --> 13:58.760
causing my family to be destroyed.

13:58.840 --> 14:01.400
With corrupt officials around,
the Treasury will have a deficit.

14:01.480 --> 14:04.080
An empty Treasury
means a lack of funds for disaster relief.

14:04.160 --> 14:07.360
Lacking funds for disaster relief
means people will die.

14:07.440 --> 14:09.680
How can I be afraid
of the lack of officials?

14:09.760 --> 14:11.560
I'm willing to be
a lone official than give in.

14:12.880 --> 14:13.760
Mr. Li,

14:14.680 --> 14:15.920
making money in a disaster

14:16.000 --> 14:18.240
not only hurts the people

14:18.840 --> 14:20.320
but also the emperor's dignity.

14:20.400 --> 14:22.640
As an official,
if you turn a blind eye to corruption

14:23.320 --> 14:24.560
for convenience,

14:24.640 --> 14:26.120
thousands of people will die in vain

14:26.200 --> 14:27.480
in this world.

14:27.560 --> 14:28.840
If this becomes a habit,

14:28.920 --> 14:30.760
it'll be like the collapse of an ant hill,

14:30.840 --> 14:32.040
which becomes uncontrollable.

14:32.760 --> 14:34.360
Who will take responsibility

14:34.440 --> 14:37.400
when the nation is exhausted of its money?

14:39.120 --> 14:40.320
In terms of political strategy,

14:40.920 --> 14:42.080
Ye Shijie wins.

14:42.640 --> 14:44.400
Ye Shijie gets five points.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.920
LI JIN, YE SHIJIE

14:46.000 --> 14:49.720
Ye Shijie and Li Jin
are both in first place.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.960
Your performance today

15:01.440 --> 15:02.880
was indeed incredible.

15:02.960 --> 15:04.200
Your performance

15:05.080 --> 15:07.080
is also novel and unique.

15:07.160 --> 15:08.760
I'll continue looking forward

15:09.880 --> 15:11.320
to your team's performance later.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.400
I'll treat everyone to a meal today.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.360
Let's have a feast

15:29.440 --> 15:31.560
to celebrate Ye Shijie's first victory.

15:32.680 --> 15:34.800
I've never seen Li Jin cornered.

15:35.280 --> 15:37.360
It seems like the Li brothers
were going all out.

15:37.440 --> 15:39.600
I wanted to give everyone
a confidence boost by winning,

15:40.240 --> 15:41.880
but I didn't expect to only get a tie.

15:42.560 --> 15:44.200
I was even so proud before.

15:44.880 --> 15:46.360
I should apologize to you all.

15:46.840 --> 15:47.680
Mr. Ye,

15:47.760 --> 15:49.680
it was already difficult
to get first place.

15:51.920 --> 15:53.680
You're up next, Jiang Jingrui.

15:53.760 --> 15:55.360
- Can you do it?
- Don't doubt me.

15:56.440 --> 15:59.720
My Go skills might not be the best,
but I'm not afraid of anyone.

15:59.800 --> 16:02.120
- You can boast after you win.
- Just wait.

16:06.880 --> 16:07.720
Give me your hand.

16:08.360 --> 16:09.200
What do you want?

16:10.520 --> 16:12.280
I want to borrow some luck.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.280
Liu Xu, you too.

16:15.880 --> 16:17.360
Why are you grabbing my hand?

16:17.840 --> 16:19.160
Can't I borrow some of your luck?

16:20.440 --> 16:21.280
Fine.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.320
Everyone should do it.

16:23.920 --> 16:24.760
Mr. Ye,

16:25.680 --> 16:26.600
your hand.

16:32.040 --> 16:33.000
What are you doing?

16:34.160 --> 16:35.520
I just want to borrow some luck.

16:36.360 --> 16:38.320
Even if you don't believe in this,

16:38.400 --> 16:39.800
there's no need to spoil the mood.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.520
All right.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.200
I'll give all my luck to you.

17:23.079 --> 17:25.079
Stand up. Let's do this together.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.040
Together.

17:27.079 --> 17:29.920
Let's hope I don't face Li Lian
in the first round

17:30.000 --> 17:32.360
and that I can get a high score.

17:32.440 --> 17:33.520
- Come on.
- All right.

17:34.080 --> 17:34.920
One, two, three.

17:35.000 --> 17:35.840
- Victory!
- Victory!

17:52.920 --> 17:54.840
Who does Shen Yurong think he is?

17:54.920 --> 17:56.920
Isn't he just arrogant
since His Majesty favors him?

17:57.000 --> 17:58.680
How dare he reprimand you in public.

17:58.760 --> 18:00.120
I think he doesn't…

18:01.800 --> 18:03.880
I think he doesn't want to stay
in the capital anymore.

18:03.960 --> 18:06.920
You can't touch Shen Yurong.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.000
Think about it.

18:09.080 --> 18:10.640
He is from a poor family

18:10.720 --> 18:12.800
and doesn't swear loyalty
to the Li and Jiang families.

18:13.880 --> 18:15.560
No one like him can still be an official.

18:16.120 --> 18:18.680
He is alone, yet his career is stable.

18:19.200 --> 18:21.640
And how can he easily
make His Majesty like him?

18:22.920 --> 18:24.320
Don't you find it weird?

18:25.560 --> 18:26.400
No, Li Jin,

18:26.880 --> 18:28.240
who is his backer?

18:31.360 --> 18:32.840
Even if someone does something to him,

18:33.320 --> 18:34.920
it won't be us.

18:35.000 --> 18:37.720
The most important thing now
is to get first place in the Annual Exam.

18:39.840 --> 18:40.760
In the Go exam,

18:42.080 --> 18:43.600
you must get first place.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.520
Don't worry.

18:45.000 --> 18:46.520
I've talked to everyone.

18:46.600 --> 18:48.480
No one would dare to win
against me at this time.

18:48.560 --> 18:49.640
Jiang Li

18:50.320 --> 18:51.760
will return to Zhennv Hall soon.

18:56.320 --> 18:57.160
Li Jin.

18:58.240 --> 19:01.080
ACADEMIC EXAM, FIRST PLACE: JIANG LI,
YE SHIJIE, JIANG JINGRUI, LIU XU

19:01.160 --> 19:03.360
JIANG LI

19:11.760 --> 19:14.080
Yurong, there's a Go situation
that I don't understand.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.400
Help me take a look.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.440
Ask your sister-in-law.

19:16.520 --> 19:17.800
Sister-in-law?

19:18.360 --> 19:20.560
Yurong, are you all right?

19:21.760 --> 19:22.640
I'm busy.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.560
Let's talk later.

19:36.280 --> 19:37.920
Why did I think about her?

19:38.880 --> 19:39.760
How could I

19:40.840 --> 19:42.160
think about her?

19:42.240 --> 19:43.760
The nights of Qingcheng Mountain

19:44.600 --> 19:46.120
are piercing cold.

19:46.200 --> 19:48.760
It's cold enough
to see through everything.

19:49.320 --> 19:54.840
Why were my loved ones so ruthless?

19:55.480 --> 19:59.320
They made me stay
on Qingcheng Mountain for ten years.

20:28.200 --> 20:29.040
You lose.

20:29.120 --> 20:30.760
I told you, you'd be fine.

20:31.360 --> 20:33.360
Your Go skills aren't bad.

20:33.440 --> 20:34.720
You lost to me on purpose.

20:34.800 --> 20:37.000
You are playing a guiding game.

20:37.080 --> 20:38.240
It seemed as if I won,

20:38.320 --> 20:40.760
but you were the one
who controlled the whole game.

20:40.840 --> 20:42.280
You were deciding who would win.

20:42.360 --> 20:44.400
Since you realized my intention,

20:44.480 --> 20:46.400
it means your skill
is up to a certain standard.

20:46.480 --> 20:47.840
Of course.

20:48.360 --> 20:51.360
Even if I haven't read my father's notes
more than 100 times,

20:51.440 --> 20:53.400
I've still read everything.

20:54.000 --> 20:56.880
Your playing style is similar to mine.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.760
However, your idea of being cautious

20:59.840 --> 21:01.640
has given me a new understanding.

21:02.680 --> 21:03.640
Speaking of which,

21:03.720 --> 21:06.680
who did you learn your skills from?

21:07.280 --> 21:09.080
I secretly studied Go notes

21:09.160 --> 21:10.440
in Zhennv Hall too.

21:10.520 --> 21:11.840
In that case,

21:11.920 --> 21:13.720
we are both prodigies.

21:13.800 --> 21:16.560
I heard there are many good players
in the Imperial Academy.

21:16.640 --> 21:18.040
Have you played against them before?

21:18.640 --> 21:20.680
I don't need to play against them to know

21:20.760 --> 21:24.120
that they play by relying on connections.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.760
Even Li Lian can get first place.

21:25.840 --> 21:28.880
That means no one dares
to win against him.

21:28.960 --> 21:30.080
If you meet them next time,

21:30.160 --> 21:31.280
you must teach them a lesson.

21:31.360 --> 21:32.720
Of course.

21:33.320 --> 21:34.400
Little Backbone.

21:41.120 --> 21:42.080
Jiang Li,

21:43.320 --> 21:44.560
don't just talk about me.

21:44.640 --> 21:47.080
You should think about your guqin exam.

21:47.640 --> 21:49.480
Ji Shuran spent a lot of money

21:49.560 --> 21:51.560
to make Jiang Ruoyao win.

21:57.040 --> 21:58.280
Madam Ji,

21:58.360 --> 22:00.920
Ruoyao's skills have improved
by leaps and bounds recently.

22:01.000 --> 22:03.200
She will surely get the top three
in the Annual Exam.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.560
Thank you, Fairy.

22:04.640 --> 22:07.320
However, I want the first place.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.800
I hope you can help me.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.640
Fairy Jinghong?

22:16.720 --> 22:18.360
She's not an ordinary person.

22:18.440 --> 22:20.480
She's the best guqin player
at Wangxian Pavilion.

22:20.560 --> 22:23.600
She is even one of the main invigilators
of this exam.

22:31.280 --> 22:32.760
Yesterday's exam was really exciting.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.760
I wonder how today's Go exam will be.

22:35.840 --> 22:36.800
Yes.

22:36.880 --> 22:39.000
Students participating in the Go exam,
please draw lots.

22:39.560 --> 22:42.000
The losing student
will be eliminated directly.

22:42.080 --> 22:43.320
The winners will advance.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.680
Why don't I see Mr. Shen today?

22:48.760 --> 22:51.080
Isn't Shen Ruyun his sister?

22:51.160 --> 22:52.280
I think he won't participate

22:52.360 --> 22:53.600
to avoid any suspicions.

22:58.560 --> 23:00.840
Tao Cheng will play against Liu Lingzi.

23:01.400 --> 23:03.440
Please give me a weak opponent.

23:03.520 --> 23:05.560
- It hurts.
- Can you not speak your thoughts?

23:05.640 --> 23:08.040
If I don't say it out loud,
how will the heavens hear me?

23:08.120 --> 23:09.160
Li Lian will play against…

23:09.240 --> 23:11.080
Not me.

23:11.160 --> 23:12.680
- Zeng Qi.
- Great.

23:13.520 --> 23:15.000
Jiang Jingrui will play against…

23:15.080 --> 23:16.720
A weak player.

23:16.800 --> 23:17.800
Shen Ruyun.

23:18.880 --> 23:20.240
Why do you always win?

23:21.560 --> 23:22.880
I'm not playing anymore.

23:22.960 --> 23:25.080
Mother, I'm not learning Go anymore!

23:26.880 --> 23:28.240
Why did you make her angry again?

23:28.320 --> 23:30.480
Yun'er is your sister-in-law.

23:30.560 --> 23:31.920
Can't you let her win?

23:32.680 --> 23:33.520
Jiang Jingrui,

23:34.160 --> 23:35.440
go all out.

23:36.320 --> 23:37.720
Do you want me to play viciously?

23:37.800 --> 23:39.760
Crush her.

23:39.840 --> 23:42.560
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY

23:44.600 --> 23:47.240
Jiang Jingrui, you can surrender
if you don't want to compete.

23:47.320 --> 23:48.560
You can't win against me anyway.

23:49.600 --> 23:50.520
In my opinion,

23:50.600 --> 23:52.000
you should think

23:52.080 --> 23:53.480
about where to cry later.

23:54.560 --> 23:56.640
- What a joke.
- Begin.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.160
What's the situation now?

24:26.240 --> 24:27.320
It doesn't look good.

24:28.120 --> 24:29.400
The corners are being controlled.

24:30.080 --> 24:31.560
The white pieces are dominating.

24:33.600 --> 24:34.960
The situation is dire,

24:35.040 --> 24:36.720
so why does Jiang Jingrui look so relaxed?

24:37.320 --> 24:38.520
He is doing it on purpose.

24:39.120 --> 24:41.280
He is setting up a trap.

24:41.360 --> 24:42.200
Is that so?

24:43.560 --> 24:45.200
The fiercer you attack,

24:45.280 --> 24:47.200
the more flaws you have.

24:50.120 --> 24:50.960
From now on,

24:51.640 --> 24:52.560
it's my turn to attack.

25:01.560 --> 25:04.080
Yun'er, you shouldn't be impatient
when you play.

25:04.720 --> 25:05.680
The fiercer you attack,

25:05.760 --> 25:07.200
the more flaws you leave.

25:07.280 --> 25:08.880
From now on, it's my turn to attack.

25:12.080 --> 25:14.680
I thought Jiang Jingrui was just a fool.

25:14.760 --> 25:15.600
I didn't expect him

25:16.080 --> 25:17.600
to be preparing

25:18.160 --> 25:20.560
for this move from the beginning.

25:20.640 --> 25:22.080
He has been showing his weakness

25:23.320 --> 25:24.480
in front of his opponent

25:25.160 --> 25:26.480
and advancing by retreating.

25:27.120 --> 25:29.080
While keeping his opponent calm,

25:29.640 --> 25:31.360
he's changing

25:31.440 --> 25:32.720
this cornered situation

25:34.400 --> 25:36.080
in front of him.

25:41.280 --> 25:42.680
DO THINGS CALMLY

25:54.640 --> 25:55.560
Place it here.

25:59.600 --> 26:00.440
You can move here.

26:02.760 --> 26:05.640
I'm sure you remember the setup just now.

26:05.720 --> 26:07.840
You only got distracted
because your piece got captured.

26:09.760 --> 26:11.680
Are you spacing out
because I captured your piece?

26:12.240 --> 26:13.480
If you place it here,

26:13.560 --> 26:14.640
this game will be over.

26:14.720 --> 26:16.520
That'll be boring. Place it here.

26:16.600 --> 26:18.960
Ms. Xiao, he keeps disturbing me!

26:19.040 --> 26:20.120
Quiet.

26:27.760 --> 26:29.000
Jiang Jingrui's playing style

26:29.080 --> 26:30.160
is not to win directly

26:30.760 --> 26:32.160
but to let his opponent see hope

26:32.240 --> 26:33.280
before guiding them.

26:34.040 --> 26:35.120
In private games,

26:35.200 --> 26:37.560
this is a way
of guiding the opponent on how to play,

26:38.120 --> 26:38.960
but in a match,

26:39.440 --> 26:42.280
this is the most arrogant
and cruel playing style.

26:57.280 --> 26:59.600
Ruyun, don't give up first.

26:59.680 --> 27:01.800
If you placed it in another spot,

27:01.880 --> 27:03.040
you could block my attack.

27:03.600 --> 27:05.120
Why do you always win?

27:25.920 --> 27:27.040
What's the matter?

27:27.720 --> 27:28.920
Do you want to flip the table?

27:32.200 --> 27:33.160
Do it.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.520
Go ahead.

27:50.080 --> 27:50.960
You…

27:51.520 --> 27:52.640
You…

27:52.720 --> 27:53.560
Me?

27:58.640 --> 27:59.640
She…

27:59.720 --> 28:00.680
She…

28:12.840 --> 28:15.200
- What's wrong? Why did she pass out?
- What's happening?

28:15.280 --> 28:16.120
Is she all right?

28:17.920 --> 28:18.840
Congratulate me.

28:21.840 --> 28:23.920
Order anything you want. I'll pay.

28:24.000 --> 28:26.080
Ye Shijie wasn't proud
when he got first place.

28:26.160 --> 28:27.920
Why are you bragging
when you get fifth place?

28:28.000 --> 28:29.120
What do you mean?

28:30.320 --> 28:32.000
I won many games

28:32.080 --> 28:33.640
and even earned a high ranking.

28:33.720 --> 28:35.560
I deserve to be praised.

28:35.640 --> 28:36.840
Right, Little Backbone?

28:37.720 --> 28:39.040
Don't be nervous.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.600
I'll give you all my good luck.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.720
And I wish you

28:41.800 --> 28:43.000
victory tomorrow.

28:48.240 --> 28:49.280
What's wrong?

28:55.280 --> 28:56.120
Liu Xu,

28:57.960 --> 28:58.840
how's your old injury?

29:00.280 --> 29:01.840
Don't worry. I'm fine.

29:02.320 --> 29:04.440
I'll stand up from where I fell down.

29:12.320 --> 29:13.600
Thanks to all of you

29:13.680 --> 29:15.760
for always patronizing my business.

29:15.840 --> 29:17.200
This is on the house today.

29:17.280 --> 29:18.120
Thank you.

29:18.640 --> 29:20.200
- Leave it here.
- Nourishing soup.

29:20.280 --> 29:21.200
Let's see what it is.

29:21.920 --> 29:22.840
Softshell turtle soup.

29:52.520 --> 29:53.360
DELAYED FAREWELL

29:53.440 --> 29:54.280
Yurong.

29:54.760 --> 29:55.840
I was terrified.

29:55.920 --> 29:58.640
I think Jiang Li is Xue Fangfei.

29:59.640 --> 30:01.160
Don't speak nonsense.

30:01.720 --> 30:04.240
How can someone
resemble her so much in this world?

30:04.320 --> 30:05.920
I've heard enough of this.

30:06.520 --> 30:08.000
Don't mention it again in the future.

30:08.080 --> 30:09.360
When I was playing Go today,

30:09.440 --> 30:10.480
I felt

30:11.080 --> 30:12.800
as if I was playing against Xue Fangfei.

30:12.880 --> 30:13.800
Stop.

30:13.880 --> 30:15.160
It felt scary.

30:15.240 --> 30:16.520
I'm sure Xue Fangfei isn't dead.

30:16.600 --> 30:18.920
- Do you think Xue Fangfei killed Jiang Li?
- I said stop it!

30:22.240 --> 30:23.920
I buried her

30:24.480 --> 30:25.560
with my own hands.

30:26.400 --> 30:27.520
Jiang Li is Jiang Li.

30:27.600 --> 30:29.840
No matter how much she resembles her,
she's not Xue Fangfei.

30:30.400 --> 30:32.000
Do you feel afraid now?

30:32.080 --> 30:35.160
When you and Mother took Wanning's gifts
and plotted to harm her,

30:35.720 --> 30:37.280
weren't you happy?

30:37.360 --> 30:38.720
After she's killed,

30:39.320 --> 30:40.480
you are afraid of ghosts now.

30:41.080 --> 30:43.040
Mother forced me to do it.

30:44.160 --> 30:45.960
I didn't want to do that.

30:46.520 --> 30:48.040
If I didn't obey Mother,

30:48.760 --> 30:50.600
she would commit suicide.

30:50.680 --> 30:53.160
Stop showing me your guilty look!

30:54.920 --> 30:55.840
I'm telling you.

30:56.600 --> 30:58.360
Xue Fangfei is dead.

30:58.440 --> 30:59.600
She's dead!

31:00.560 --> 31:02.160
She died on Qingcheng Mountain.

31:03.120 --> 31:04.480
Do you remember it now?

31:06.080 --> 31:07.600
- I remember.
- Louder!

31:09.480 --> 31:10.440
I remember.

31:10.520 --> 31:11.360
Get lost!

31:21.000 --> 31:23.080
Mother!

31:27.480 --> 31:32.280
DELAYED FAREWELL

31:45.600 --> 31:47.160
After the guqin exam is over tomorrow,

31:47.240 --> 31:49.360
I'll get back the money
from my previous bet.

31:54.400 --> 31:55.320
Don't show a long face.

31:55.400 --> 31:56.840
All right, I'll share some with you.

31:56.920 --> 31:58.840
After I get the money,
I'll buy you many drinks.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.440
I don't think so.

32:00.520 --> 32:01.440
My lord,

32:01.520 --> 32:02.640
what do you think?

32:02.720 --> 32:04.400
Are you waiting for me
to give you money for drinks?

32:04.480 --> 32:05.840
No. My lord.

32:05.920 --> 32:06.960
Forgive me for saying this.

32:07.040 --> 32:08.600
Why did you place your bet on Jiang Li?

32:08.680 --> 32:09.880
She will never win.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.760
Ye Shijie and the Li family are tied.

32:11.840 --> 32:13.360
Li Lian got first place in the Go Exam.

32:13.440 --> 32:14.880
Jiang Jingrui only got fifth place.

32:14.960 --> 32:16.760
Only Liu Xu and Jiang Li are left.

32:16.840 --> 32:17.880
Forget that Meng Hongjin

32:17.960 --> 32:20.440
always won the top three
in the academy horseback archery exams.

32:20.520 --> 32:22.240
Even if Liu Xu wins against Meng Hongjin,

32:22.320 --> 32:25.080
she'd only close the gap
left by Jiang Jingrui's loss.

32:25.160 --> 32:27.680
In the last round, the guqin exam,

32:27.760 --> 32:29.120
Jiang Li must get first place.

32:29.200 --> 32:32.240
The Li family's team
is sending Wang Qingqing.

32:32.320 --> 32:34.440
She has been a palace musician's student
for many years.

32:34.520 --> 32:36.040
How can Jiang Li win against her?

32:36.120 --> 32:38.000
Even if Jiang Li
wins against Wang Qingqing,

32:38.080 --> 32:40.680
don't forget that she bet
on getting first place.

32:40.760 --> 32:43.280
That means she must win
against Jiang Ruoyao, who got first place

32:43.360 --> 32:45.080
in the guqin exam
for many consecutive years.

32:45.160 --> 32:48.120
I'm afraid Ms. Jiang Li
will soon return to Zhennv Hall.

32:48.200 --> 32:49.120
Go and check

32:50.080 --> 32:51.160
on her hands' condition.

32:51.240 --> 32:53.040
- Yes.
- I'll go.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.280
Why did this man fall into the jar?

33:48.360 --> 33:49.240
Have I

33:50.040 --> 33:51.480
rushed this?

33:58.320 --> 33:59.840
She's so disobedient.

34:01.200 --> 34:04.680
ANNUAL EXAM, THIRD DAY

34:06.440 --> 34:12.040
WORK HARD AND PERSEVERE
FOR PROMISING PROSPECT

34:26.960 --> 34:28.679
In this archery competition,

34:28.760 --> 34:31.480
students will be assessed
with the Heaven's Bow Technique

34:32.000 --> 34:33.280
founded by the late emperor.

34:33.360 --> 34:34.880
What is the Heaven's Bow Technique?

34:34.960 --> 34:36.239
Students will shoot at balls

34:36.320 --> 34:37.840
from a ball launcher with their bow.

34:37.920 --> 34:39.760
The more balls they shoot,
the more points they get.

34:39.840 --> 34:42.199
We've always prepared
for horseback archery.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.520
Why did they suddenly change it?

34:43.600 --> 34:45.920
The archery competition format
always changes.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.719
They shoot jars, targets, and balls.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.080
You shoot on horseback sometimes

34:49.159 --> 34:50.440
and shoot while running at times.

34:50.520 --> 34:52.239
Since we are competing as a team,

34:52.320 --> 34:53.760
we'll shoot while suspended midair.

34:53.840 --> 34:54.960
The idea is still the same.

34:55.040 --> 34:59.480
First group. Zhou Yanbang and Zhuge Pei.

34:59.560 --> 35:02.080
Go to your positions!

35:03.560 --> 35:06.400
- Zhou Yanbang will surely win!
- Zhou Yanbang will surely win!

35:06.480 --> 35:12.200
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!

35:12.280 --> 35:13.800
Begin.

35:13.880 --> 35:17.480
WORK HARD AND PERSEVERE
FOR PROMISING PROSPECT

35:19.240 --> 35:20.320
How is your hand?

35:21.880 --> 35:22.720
I'm fine.

35:22.800 --> 35:24.720
Are you anxious? Are you scared?

35:24.800 --> 35:26.120
- Are you nervous?
- Shut up.

35:26.200 --> 35:27.880
Be calm, collected, confident.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.040
I told you to shut up.

35:29.120 --> 35:30.400
Liu Xu, you are the greatest.

35:30.480 --> 35:32.080
Jiang Jingrui,
will you die if you shut up?

35:38.280 --> 35:41.280
The exam for the first group begins.

35:47.160 --> 35:48.920
Get ready!

35:55.800 --> 35:56.880
Launch!

36:19.560 --> 36:24.280
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!

36:24.360 --> 36:30.160
- Zhou Yanbang will surely win!
- Zhou Yanbang will surely win!

36:30.240 --> 36:33.320
- Pull harder and higher in the next round.
- All right.

36:33.400 --> 36:35.240
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!
- Victory for Zhou Yanbang!

36:35.840 --> 36:37.480
Launch!

37:07.720 --> 37:09.280
Mr. Zhou, you are amazing.

37:09.360 --> 37:13.160
- Zhou Yanbang!
- Zhou Yanbang!

37:13.240 --> 37:19.760
- Zhou Yanbang!
- Zhou Yanbang!

37:21.360 --> 37:25.160
Next group, Meng Hongjin and Liu Xu.

37:26.200 --> 37:33.000
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

37:33.080 --> 37:38.880
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

37:38.960 --> 37:44.960
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

37:46.920 --> 37:47.800
Liu Xu,

37:47.880 --> 37:50.760
I didn't expect you
to participate in this competition.

37:50.840 --> 37:52.520
If you fall again,

37:52.600 --> 37:54.680
your hand might be crippled.

37:56.680 --> 37:58.960
Just because
of this country bumpkin girl's bluff,

37:59.040 --> 38:00.160
is it worth it?

38:00.240 --> 38:02.160
Mind your own business,

38:02.240 --> 38:03.560
you shrew.

38:08.640 --> 38:10.760
Go to your positions!

38:20.760 --> 38:22.400
Get ready!

38:22.480 --> 38:23.720
Launch!

38:45.040 --> 38:50.480
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

38:50.560 --> 38:57.360
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

38:59.640 --> 39:01.240
Liu Xu, are you all right?

39:01.800 --> 39:03.040
I'm fine.

39:03.520 --> 39:06.000
Liu Xu is usually fierce.
What's wrong with her today?

39:06.560 --> 39:08.160
Perhaps she has a fear of heights.

39:08.240 --> 39:09.440
- Fear of heights?
- Yes.

39:10.000 --> 39:12.040
She will feel dizzy
if her feet leave the ground.

39:15.520 --> 39:16.760
Let's make her hang lower.

39:17.360 --> 39:18.200
It's no use.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.680
As long as she's suspended midair,

39:19.760 --> 39:21.080
she will feel dizzy.

39:22.560 --> 39:23.880
How do you know that?

39:23.960 --> 39:25.760
When I was little, my family wanted me
to excel in academics and sports,

39:25.840 --> 39:28.600
but they discovered those
who fear heights can't practice Qinggong.

39:35.120 --> 39:35.960
Pull higher.

39:38.920 --> 39:39.960
Launch!

39:53.400 --> 39:56.920
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

39:57.000 --> 40:01.800
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

40:01.880 --> 40:04.120
Liu Xu, surrender if you can't do it.

40:04.200 --> 40:05.360
Don't embarrass yourself here.

40:10.680 --> 40:12.440
Jiang Li, I…

40:12.520 --> 40:13.360
You haven't lost yet.

40:14.480 --> 40:15.840
It's not time to say sorry yet.

40:17.040 --> 40:18.360
Who said I was saying sorry?

40:18.920 --> 40:20.840
I want all of you to work hard

40:20.920 --> 40:22.000
and pull me higher!

40:25.720 --> 40:26.680
Aren't you scared?

40:27.600 --> 40:28.480
I am,

40:29.000 --> 40:30.720
but I want to win!

40:33.640 --> 40:34.480
We believe in you.

40:34.560 --> 40:36.440
- We believe in you!
- We believe in you!

40:37.160 --> 40:38.160
Come on!

40:54.920 --> 40:59.800
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

40:59.880 --> 41:05.160
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:05.240 --> 41:08.160
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

41:08.240 --> 41:11.880
- Liu Xu!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:11.960 --> 41:14.360
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:19.080 --> 41:21.240
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:21.320 --> 41:22.920
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

41:23.000 --> 41:24.880
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:24.960 --> 41:26.800
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

41:26.880 --> 41:28.160
- Meng Hongjin!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:28.240 --> 41:30.560
- Liu Xu!
- Meng Hongjin!

41:36.360 --> 41:37.840
Get ready!

41:39.280 --> 41:40.880
Launch!

42:14.720 --> 42:17.200
How do you have the courage
to compete for first place?

42:18.040 --> 42:19.200
Because I can't accept it.

42:19.760 --> 42:21.520
I can't accept being stuck in Zhennv Hall

42:22.080 --> 42:23.760
and being trampled on
at the School of Integrity.

42:24.480 --> 42:25.400
I want to compete.

42:26.040 --> 42:28.360
I want to break free
from this stifling place.

43:40.640 --> 43:42.000
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

43:56.600 --> 44:02.840
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:08.200 --> 44:09.480
- Come on!
- Let's go!

44:09.560 --> 44:13.400
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:13.480 --> 44:17.360
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:17.440 --> 44:18.800
You're amazing, Liu Xu!

44:18.880 --> 44:22.120
- Liu Xu, well done!
- Liu Xu!

44:22.200 --> 44:27.960
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:31.440 --> 44:34.160
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:36.600 --> 44:39.000
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:39.080 --> 44:43.760
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:43.840 --> 44:47.160
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:47.240 --> 44:48.760
Let's go! Come on!

44:48.840 --> 44:52.480
- Liu Xiu!
- I'm going too.

44:52.560 --> 44:58.760
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

44:58.840 --> 45:02.720
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:02.800 --> 45:05.800
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:08.080 --> 45:15.000
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:15.080 --> 45:18.160
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:18.240 --> 45:20.680
Mr. Shen! Ms. Xiao!

45:20.760 --> 45:23.600
I am injured!

45:24.280 --> 45:25.400
Where are you injured?

45:25.480 --> 45:27.000
My butt is injured!

45:27.080 --> 45:30.440
Someone shot my butt
with a concealed weapon!

45:31.200 --> 45:32.480
Why did they only shoot your…

45:34.720 --> 45:35.560
butt?

45:35.640 --> 45:36.800
I don't want this either!

45:36.880 --> 45:39.880
It's all my fault for causing jealousy
due to my appearance and talent!

45:39.960 --> 45:43.120
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:43.200 --> 45:45.280
- Where's the concealed weapon?
- It's here.

45:45.360 --> 45:49.240
- Liu Xu!
- Liu Xu!

45:49.320 --> 45:52.280
- Blood?
- Liu Xu!

45:52.360 --> 45:56.320
- My butt…
- Liu Xu!

45:57.560 --> 45:58.960
RESPECT AND EMULATE THE EXCELLENT

45:59.040 --> 46:01.680
- I heard its rank is high.
- Jiang Li's team is still one place lower

46:01.760 --> 46:03.120
than Li Lian's team now.

46:04.360 --> 46:06.680
Wang Qingqing, Prefect Wang's daughter,
on Mr. Li's team,

46:06.760 --> 46:08.400
got second place
in last year's guqin exam.

46:08.480 --> 46:09.760
Jiang Ruoyao was in first place.

46:09.840 --> 46:12.880
Doesn't this mean Jiang Li must win
against Ruoyao to get first place?

46:12.960 --> 46:13.840
- Right.
- Yes.

46:13.920 --> 46:15.080
It seems like

46:16.000 --> 46:19.320
an exciting fight between family members
is about to begin.

46:22.640 --> 46:27.600
ANNUAL EXAM RANKING

46:28.120 --> 46:30.240
TAIJI HALL

46:37.680 --> 46:40.520
The wager between Jiang Li and Li Lian

46:40.600 --> 46:42.200
has become the city's hot topic.

46:42.280 --> 46:44.560
I wonder if my niece, Ruoyao,

46:45.160 --> 46:47.160
can still get a good result this time.

46:48.040 --> 46:50.200
Consort Li, don't worry.

46:50.280 --> 46:51.960
Ruoyao is my favorite student.

46:52.040 --> 46:54.280
Her guqin skill
has always been one of the best.

46:54.760 --> 46:57.360
I don't think getting first place again

46:58.040 --> 46:59.800
will be a problem.

47:01.520 --> 47:03.440
I only wonder if your class

47:03.520 --> 47:05.320
has any up-and-coming talents.

47:08.240 --> 47:09.920
In terms of technique,

47:10.000 --> 47:13.840
I don't think there's anyone
who can compare to Ruoyao.

47:15.160 --> 47:16.840
Ms. Xiao, have some tea.

47:39.000 --> 47:40.120
Be careful.

47:45.960 --> 47:48.440
Are you prepared
for the competition tomorrow, Jiang Li?

47:50.000 --> 47:51.680
If Jiang Li wins the competition tomorrow,

47:51.760 --> 47:53.000
our team will win the wager.

47:53.760 --> 47:56.040
Ruoyao, we are from the same family.

47:56.120 --> 47:58.280
Help your family out
and give her a handicap.

47:58.360 --> 47:59.680
If I don't do my best,

47:59.760 --> 48:02.160
isn't it a sign
of disrespect for Jiang Li?

48:10.520 --> 48:11.360
Jiang Li,

48:12.520 --> 48:13.600
are you confident tomorrow?

48:22.120 --> 48:23.280
It all comes down to effort.

48:24.600 --> 48:25.720
It all comes down to effort.

48:26.840 --> 48:27.800
Jiang Jingrui,

48:28.680 --> 48:29.560
go home first.

48:30.080 --> 48:31.800
I want to go out and take a stroll.

48:31.880 --> 48:34.480
Remember to bring me some rice cakes
if you pass by the shop.

48:35.520 --> 48:36.400
Sure.

48:36.480 --> 48:37.360
I'll go back first.

48:42.880 --> 48:44.440
Duke Su, why are you looking for me?

48:47.120 --> 48:47.960
Your hand.

48:56.360 --> 48:58.080
You are the first person

48:59.160 --> 49:00.440
that Situ Jiuyue failed to treat.

49:01.000 --> 49:02.680
In the past few days,
I've been practicing--

49:02.760 --> 49:05.120
You were too impatient
and failed at the last step.

49:05.760 --> 49:06.600
Li.

49:08.200 --> 49:09.920
You still haven't grown up.

49:11.640 --> 49:13.960
It seems like
you don't want to win tomorrow.

49:14.720 --> 49:17.720
I will rest well today.

49:18.560 --> 49:21.000
Duke Su, please let go and let me go back.

49:26.320 --> 49:27.880
It's not embarrassing to owe me a favor.

49:31.360 --> 49:32.920
Duke Su, please give me pointers.

49:33.000 --> 49:35.000
Send a message to Situ Jiuyue.

49:35.080 --> 49:37.040
Tell her this girl ruined her reputation.

49:39.200 --> 49:40.040
- Let's go.
- Duke Su.

49:40.760 --> 49:41.760
Yes, my lord.

49:55.560 --> 49:57.480
DUKE SU'S MANSION

49:57.560 --> 49:58.760
RETURN OF THE CLOUDS

49:58.840 --> 50:02.280
Xiao Heng! How is my reputation ruined?

50:07.640 --> 50:09.080
It's you again.

50:09.720 --> 50:11.040
Did you owe her in your past life?

50:11.600 --> 50:12.520
Check her injury.

50:23.760 --> 50:25.400
Couldn't you even wait two days?

50:26.160 --> 50:27.120
What did you do again?

50:27.680 --> 50:31.000
It didn't hurt anymore
after you treated me.

50:31.920 --> 50:32.960
I thought I was fine

50:33.880 --> 50:36.080
and played for a while
because I couldn't help it.

50:36.960 --> 50:38.120
Do you want to win so badly?

50:38.200 --> 50:39.480
Please help me, Ms. Situ.

50:43.160 --> 50:45.640
The meridians of your hand are damaged.

50:45.720 --> 50:48.560
If you want to fully recover,
it'll take at least three days.

50:49.120 --> 50:50.080
She only has one day.

50:53.840 --> 50:55.240
Please find someone else then.

50:57.520 --> 51:00.480
It turns out there's an illness
that the best physician can't treat.

51:01.080 --> 51:02.280
Look.

51:02.360 --> 51:03.760
You scared her.

51:07.880 --> 51:09.720
I'm the best poison expert.

51:09.800 --> 51:10.720
Xiao Heng,

51:11.560 --> 51:13.040
if you insist on treating her,

51:13.760 --> 51:15.120
there's still a way.

51:18.360 --> 51:20.000
But if she can't take it,

51:21.200 --> 51:22.360
she will die.

51:27.640 --> 51:29.880
Do you dare to take a gamble?

51:37.000 --> 51:39.880
I ended up this way
because I didn't obey your instructions.

51:40.440 --> 51:43.000
However, I'm willing
to take a gamble if it's useful.
